1077..1152 Comment "/// A forged section: the loop arm answers with the field\'s path unchanged,"
1153..1228 Comment "/// typed at the motive at `x`, where the arm owes the motive at `Loop(x)`:"
1229..1301 Comment "/// a path from `Loop(spin(wind(x)))` to `Loop(x)`. The machine does not"
1302..1369 Comment "/// decide the two path types, and the arm is refused as undecided."
